        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Coached by national-level swimmers</span>
        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Lifeguarded facilities only</span>
        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>100% of revenue reinvested</span>
      </div>
