  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     MISSION STRIP
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="mission" style="padding-top:40px">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Mission</p>
      <h2 style="margin:14px 0 20px">Democratizing elite technical swim instruction.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Surge was founded on a simple observation: the drills, corrections, and progressions taught by $200-an-hour technique coaches are the same ones a national-level swimmer has already lived through. We deliver that knowledge in small groups, at a price built for real families, and we put every dollar back into the water.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 17c2 0 2-2 4-2s2 2 4 2 2-2 4-2 2 2 4 2M3 12c2 0 2-2 4-2s2 2 4 2 2-2 4-2 2 2 4 2M3 7c2 0 2-2 4-2s2 2 4 2 2-2 4-2 2 2 4 2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Proven technical mastery</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">Founded by Thomas Bai, a national-level swimmer and experienced instructor who reached elite standards through the same biomechanical coaching we now make accessible.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4M9 10.5l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Video analysis &amp; race analytics</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">Every swimmer is filmed, measured, and tracked (stroke count, distance per stroke, tempo, and turn splits) so progress is a number, not a feeling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c0-3.6 2.9-6 6.5-6s6.5 2.4 6.5 6M15 15.5c3 0 6 1.8 6 4.5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Volunteer-powered, non-profit</h3>
